	)
	(text "Sensor connectors J11..J18: JST XH 5-pin, same pinout as J1 on the sensor boards. IR LEDs J3: JST XH 5-pin. Photodiodes J4: twisted pair or shielded, ~30 cm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 378.46 0)
